# Terraform (Phase 9)
# Provider binaries — 600MB+, re-created by `terraform init`.
terraform/.terraform/
# State names every resource that exists, and can contain secret values in
# plain text. Local state is a deliberate choice for a 3-day burst cluster
# (see terraform/versions.tf); committing it would not be.
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
crash.log
# .terraform.lock.hcl IS committed on purpose: it pins provider versions so
# every apply resolves the same code.
